{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is simple to play, with players using the mouse to search for hidden NPCs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interaction is possible with mouse clicks and it is a single game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game allows players to save while playing, and there is no &quot;game over&quot; for players, making it easy to play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some NPCs like to hide, so we recommend exploring the map thoroughly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game consists of 20 pages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can play the game even if you don't understand English.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game allows players to interact with the game only using the mouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406660/extras/6de2f404e0a60960baa097cd46dd1e2f.avif?t=1736073362\" width=600 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Look for the NPC on the map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406660/extras/6eef3c0b9190ea3f6cbed5ea0deeb157.avif?t=1736073362\" width=600 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can see pixel graphic NPCs and backgrounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406660/extras/ca7a4a472f38fa34b7d677e20a6556f2.avif?t=1736073362\" width=600 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can see NPC profile pictures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406660/extras/c6dbc1cf43c218dc9e2b17eb33771023.avif?t=1736073362\" width=600 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A